---

This repository contains both specification prose (moca-core-spec.md, the
documents under spec/ and docs/, and the profile specifications under
profiles/) and executable reference tooling (the CLIs under tools/ and the
validation scripts under scripts/). All of it is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

The example packages under examples/ and profiles/*/examples/ are illustrative
fixtures, also Apache-2.0 licensed. They are not production content and their
declared `license` fields describe the example package itself.

fixtures/signing-keys/ contains a deliberately published, non-production
Ed25519 keypair used only to sign this repository's own example packages. It
carries no trust value; see that directory's README.md.
